6009 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Earlier\054 cars used to be where people could operate things without looking\056\nThen things changed\056\nScreens got bigger\056 Features multiplied\056 Buttons disappeared\056\nFunctions that once took a second became menus\054 gestures and taps\056\n\nAnd that made me wonder\072\nAre cars actually becoming easier to use\077\nOr are we simply giving them more things to do\077\n\nThat question became the starting point for this project\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 6010 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

