6015 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Mechanical Era\n\nThe interface was almost entirely physical and directly connected to the car\047s functions\056 Analogue gauges\054 levers and switches offered immediate feedback with minimal cognitive effort\056\n\n\nPorsche 356)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 6016 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
