6019 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Button Era\n\nAs cars gained more functions\054 dedicated buttons and knobs became the dominant interaction method\056 Each function had a clear physical control\054 encouraging consistency and muscle memory\056\n\n\nPorsche 911 \050964\051)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 6020 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
