6023 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Early Digital Era\n\nElectronics began entering the cockpit without completely replacing physical interaction\056 Digital displays and early infotainment added new capabilities while traditional buttons\054 knobs and analogue instruments remained prominent\056\n\n\nPorsche 911 \050996\051)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 6024 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
