6027 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Screen Era\n\nTouchscreens increasingly became the central interface\054 allowing manufacturers to consolidate many functions into a single digital layer\056 This brought flexibility and visual richness\054 but also moved more interactions behind screens and menus\056\n\n\nPorsche Panamera \050970\051)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 6028 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
