6031 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Rebalancing Era\n\nThe industry is now moving toward a hybrid approach\054 recognising that not every function benefits from being digital\056 Screens handle dynamic and information\055rich tasks\054 while frequently used or critical functions remain immediately accessible\056\n\nPorsche Panamera \0503rd generation\051)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 6032 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
