  << /ActualText (As vehicles become increasingly software\055defined\054 more functions are being moved from dedicated physical controls into touchscreens and layered digital interfaces\056\nWhile this enables greater functionality\054 flexibility and visual richness\054 it can also increase the driver\047s visual\054 manual and cognitive workload\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
