6045 0 obj
  << /ActualText (My relationship with cars started long before I began studying their interfaces\056\nSince 2011\054 I\220ve experienced the shift from simple\054 physical controls to increasingly screen\055driven interiors\204\nnot just as a designer\054 but as a passenger and a driver\056\n\nThis personal journey made me question something\072\nas cars become more technologically capable\054 are they also becoming more mentally demanding to use\077)
     /K [ 20 ]
     /P 6046 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
