6053 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In 2022\054 they tested twelve cars while drivers performed basic tasks like adjusting the climate\054 changing the radio\054 and controlling the display\n\204 all while driving at 110 kilometres per hour\056\nThe results were striking\056 The 2005 Volvo V70 completed the tasks in just 10 seconds\054 while the MG Marvel R took almost 45 seconds \204 meaning the driver travelled more than four times the distance\056)
     /K [ 24 ]
     /P 6054 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
