  << /ActualText (Button Era \055 Porsche 911 \050964\051\n\nDedicated buttons and knobs gave drivers direct control over individual functions\054 making frequent actions easier to access by feel\056 However\054 as features increased\054 crowded dashboards and numerous similar\055looking controls could make certain functions confusing to locate and operate\056)
