6159 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Rebalancing Era \055 Porsche Panamera \0503rd generation\051\n\nPhysical controls are returning for essential functions\054 while digital screens handle navigation\054 infotainment and other advanced features\056 However\054 with digital interfaces still dominating much of the dashboard\054 large screens and layered menus can be distracting and difficult to operate while driving\056)
     /K [ 77 ]
