  << /ActualText (The solution lies somewhere in between \055\nan intuitive car interior that brings physical and digital controls together in the right balance\056 A design where essential functions are effortless to access\054 digital technology serves a clear purpose\054 and the driver can focus on the road rather than figuring out the interface\056)
