6163 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This AI generated image represents a possible direction of what an ideal car interior looks like\056\056\056\nbut an intuitive car interior requires more than a visual balance between physical and digital controls\056\n\nMy research goes deeper into how users interact with these systems\054 how different controls affect cognitive load\054 and which functions deserve immediate physical access versus a digital interface\056\n\nThe goal is to go beyond how the dashboard looks and understand how it can work better for the person behind the wheel\056)
     /K [ 79 ]
     /P 6164 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
