6167 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I presented my initial automotive HMI concept to car experts to understand their perspectives on accessibility\054 control placement and the overall driving experience\056\n\nKey feedback themes\072\nAccessibility\072 Drive\055mode buttons and essential controls needed better placement\056\nCognitive Load\072 Excessive steering\055wheel buttons and overlapping screen menus could make interactions more difficult\056\nPracticality\072 Charging ports\054 storage\054 handbrake placement and screen repairability needed reconsideration\056\nA new direction\072 Rather than creating another conventional infotainment system\054 I was encouraged to explore a more original approach\056)
     /K [ 81 ]
     /P 6168 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

