6175 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Inspired by Porsche\056 Designed around the Driver\056\n\nThe Porsche Mission S explores a different approach to automotive interfaces by using a smartphone as the primary digital display instead of a permanently integrated infotainment screen\056\n\nInspired by this direction\054 I explored how a phone\055first HMI could simplify the dashboard while keeping essential driving functions intuitive and accessible\056\n\nMy focus is on more than removing a screen\056 It is about giving every function the right place\054 reducing unnecessary cognitive load\054 and ensuring technology serves the driver rather than distracting them\056)
     /K [ 85 ]
     /P 6176 0 R
     /Pg 6005 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
